  "title": "Day-After-Thanksgiving Turkey Carcass Soup",
  "description": "This-day-after-Thanksgiving turkey carcass soup recipe turns leftover turkey, stuffing, and vegetables into a second comforting post-holiday meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Beverly Burton"
  ],
